# One-off diagnostic scripts. Each existed to answer a single question - print me
# these lines, tell me what that route returns - and answered it. Keeping them
# makes the project root unreadable for whoever comes next.
#
# The tools that stay are named: healthcheck, fuzz, auditroutes, demo_reset,
# mint_keys, testshopper. Anything matching below is scratch.
show*.py
find*.py
check*.py
test*.py
fix*.py
add*.py
wire*.py
patch*.py
rm*.py
what*.py
list*.py

!testshopper.py
